<view class="outing-page detail-page" wx:if="{{place}}">
  <view class="detail-heading"><text class="eyebrow">{{place.city}} · {{categoryLabel}}</text><view class="detail-name">{{place.name}}</view><view class="detail-status status {{place.status}}">{{statusLabel}}</view><text class="detail-intro">{{place.status === 'denied' ? '有作者曾被拒绝携犬进入，请先联系门店。' : place.status === 'review' ? '分店、准入或地址信息需要重点核对，先问清楚再出发。' : '一份给你和它的出门参考，携宠条件以门店当前答复为准。'}}</text></view>
  <view class="outing-section address-section"><view class="section-label">地点位置</view><view class="address-text">{{place.location}}</view><text class="section-note">{{place.address ? '地址来自出行分享，尚未核对门牌与分店。' : '这是位置线索，具体门牌还需确认。'}}</text><button class="outing-secondary" bindtap="copyAddress">{{place.address ? '复制地址' : '复制位置线索'}}</button></view>
  <view class="outing-section"><view class="section-label">带它去之前</view><text class="section-note">以下是历史到访或帖子中的线索，“待确认”表示暂未找到明确说明。</text><view class="policy-grid"><view wx:for="{{policyRows}}" wx:key="key" class="policy-item {{item.uncertain ? 'uncertain' : ''}}"><text>{{item.label}}</text><view>{{item.value}}</view></view></view><view class="policy-caution" wx:if="{{place.status !== 'pending'}}">这些条件也需重新确认，请优先向门店询问当前规则。</view></view>
  <view class="outing-section"><view class="section-label">携宠注意事项</view><view class="condition-line" wx:for="{{highlights}}" wx:key="*this"><text class="condition-dot">·</text><text>{{item}}</text></view><view class="ask-note">建议确认：具体分店、狗狗体型、室内座位、推车和预约要求。</view></view>
  <view class="outing-section sources-section"><button class="sources-toggle" bindtap="toggleSources"><view>参考来源<text>{{place.sources.length}} 条出行分享 · 未联系商家核实</text></view><text>{{sourceOpen ? '−' : '+'}}</text></button><view wx:if="{{sourceOpen}}"><view class="source-entry" wx:for="{{place.sources}}" wx:key="noteId"><view class="source-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="source-time">帖子显示时间：{{item.dateText || '未提供'}}<text>资料采集：{{item.collectedAt || '未记录'}}</text></view><view class="source-review">{{item.review}}</view><view wx:for="{{item.comments}}" wx:for-item="comment" wx:key="*this" class="source-comment">评论补充：{{comment}}</view><button class="text-button" data-id="{{item.noteId}}" bindtap="copySource">复制原帖链接 ↗</button></view></view></view>
  <button class="more-city" bindtap="moreInCity">继续看看{{place.city}}的其他地点 →</button><button class="home-link" bindtap="goHome">返回爪爪日常首页</button>
  <view class="detail-dock"><button class="dock-save {{saved ? 'is-saved' : ''}}" bindtap="toggleSaved">{{saved ? '♥ 已收藏' : '♡ 收藏'}}</button><button class="outing-secondary" bindtap="openSaved">我的清单</button><button class="outing-primary" open-type="share">分享地点 ↗</button></view>
</view>
<view class="outing-page outing-empty" wx:else><view class="empty-symbol">⌕</view><view>这个地点暂时无法找到</view><text>链接可能已经失效，可以按城市重新找一找。</text><button class="outing-primary" bindtap="moreInCity">去找地点</button></view>
